    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Orristown is a beautifully extended traditional two-up, two-down cottage that has been thoughtfully modernised to an exceptional standard, offering true “turnkey” or “hang your hat” condition. Full of charm and character, this delightful home seamlessly combines its original cottage appeal with the comfort and convenience of modern living, making it an ideal permanent residence, holiday retreat, or investment opportunity. The bright and welcoming accommodation has been carefully designed to maximise both comfort and functionality. The ground floor comprises a cosy living room, a spacious and well-appointed kitchen/dining area perfect for family living and entertaining, and a stylish family bathroom. Upstairs, the cottage retains its traditional character with two comfortable and well-proportioned bedrooms. A host of modern upgrades enhance the property, including double-glazed uPVC windows and oil-\u001dred central heating, while many original features have been sympathetically retained. Wide-board flooring, attractive tiling, and tasteful décor throughout create a warm and inviting atmosphere that is ready to be enjoyed from day one. Outside, the property occupies a mature and beautifully maintained site with colourful gardens that provide a peaceful and private setting. Established plants, shrubs, and seasonal flowers surround the cottage, while a variety of sunny seating areas offer the perfect places to relax and enjoy the tranquil countryside. Ample off-street parking further adds to the property’s practicality. Ideally situated, Orristown enjoys the best of both worlds – a peaceful rural setting with excellent access to local amenities. Piercestown village is just 2km away and offers a primary school, pharmacy, church, and sporting facilities. The award-winning Blue Flag beach at Rosslare Strand is only 7km away, while the nearby villages of Kilinick and Ballycogley provide a further range of everyday services and amenities. Wexford Town is just 8km from the property, and the nearby N25 provides excellent connectivity to the wider region. Combining timeless character, modern comforts, and an exceptionally convenient location, Orristown is a truly special home that will appeal to a wide range of buyers.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
