        "Content": "Property Accommodation\r\nPorch – (4.8mx 2m), Tiled floor opening to\r\nLiving Room – (3.7m x 3.5m), Wood floor, feature fireplace, stairs off door to\r\nKitchen/ Diner – (4.0m x 2.2m), Tiled floor and splashback cabinets at waist and eye level, dual aspect.\r\nInner Hall – (1.4m x 5.9m), Tiled floor, hotpress off, door to\r\nGuest WC – (1.8m x 1.4m), WC, WHB, tile flooring.\r\nBathroom – (2.5m x 2.2m), WC, WHB, bath with shower over, tiled floor and part tiled walls, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nLanding – (1.2m x 0.7m)\r\nBedroom No. 1 – (3.6m x 3.5m), Carpet flooring.\r\nBedroom No. 2 – (3.5m x 2.1m), Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nOutside: Mature gardens with shrubs, sunny seating areas, ample parking with gravel drive.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, private sewerage, oil fired central heating.\r\nBER: E1 Ber No: 103718870 Performance indicator: 338.97 kWh/m2/yr\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072"
